{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01N8xxvmsxVqUJGhVrmaLu3o","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Cloudflare Workers script size limit compressed free paid\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Limits · Cloudflare Workers docs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/platform/limits/\"},{\"title\":\"Deploy larger Workers — up to 64 MiB for both free and paid plans · Changelog\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2026-09-04-increased-worker-size-limit/\"},{\"title\":\"Limits · Cloudflare Workflows docs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workflows/reference/limits/\"},{\"title\":\"Limits & pricing · Cloudflare Workers docs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/ci-cd/builds/limits-and-pricing/\"},{\"title\":\"Workers KV - free to try, with increased limits!\",\"url\":\"https://blog.cloudflare.com/workers-kv-free-tier/\"},{\"title\":\"Limits · Cloudflare D1 docs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/d1/platform/limits/\"},{\"title\":\"Workers for Platforms Changelog\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/product/workers-for-platforms/\"},{\"title\":\"Limits · Cloudflare Workers KV docs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/kv/platform/limits/\"},{\"title\":\"How we rebuilt Cloudflare Workers’ module registry for Node.js compatibility\",\"url\":\"https://blog.cloudflare.com/workers-module-registry-nodejs/\"},{\"title\":\"Dogfooding at scale: migrating cdnjs to Cloudflare’s Developer Platform\",\"url\":\"https://blog.cloudflare.com/cdnjs-dev-platform-migration/\"}]\n\nCloudflare no longer enforces a compressed size limit for Workers. The uncompressed bundle is capped at 64 MiB on both Free and Paid plans.\n\n- **Current limit:** The Limits docs list a Worker size (uncompressed) limit of 64 MiB for both Workers Free and Workers Paid.\n- **Compressed limit removed:** A September 2026 changelog entry says the former compressed caps of 3 MB free / 10 MB paid have been removed. It adds that Cloudflare now only checks the uncompressed bundle size, which is 64 MiB across all plans.\n- **Checking size:** Running a dry-run deploy reports an uncompressed \"Total Upload\" figure, which is the number that counts against the limit. The gzip figure is informational only.\n- **Conflicting source:** The Workflows limits page, which is about 20 days old, still lists 3MB max script size for Free and 10MB for Paid. That appears to be stale, since the newer changelog and Limits docs say otherwise.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2bc7c7bf-0ecb-46e3-8870-df07edda2d72","uuid":"c713de88-bda0-4a83-a505-8a6a9daf361f","timestamp":"2026-10-11T03:13:03.880Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Cloudflare Workers script size limit compressed free paid","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01UVRsapZbU4QrXUkMbbJLtL","content":[{"title":"Limits · Cloudflare Workers docs","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/platform/limits/"},{"title":"Deploy larger Workers — up to 64 MiB for both free and paid plans · Changelog","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2026-09-04-increased-worker-size-limit/"},{"title":"Limits · Cloudflare Workflows docs","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workflows/reference/limits/"},{"title":"Limits & pricing · Cloudflare Workers docs","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/ci-cd/builds/limits-and-pricing/"},{"title":"Workers KV - free to try, with increased limits!","url":"https://blog.cloudflare.com/workers-kv-free-tier/"},{"title":"Limits · Cloudflare D1 docs","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/d1/platform/limits/"},{"title":"Workers for Platforms Changelog","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/product/workers-for-platforms/"},{"title":"Limits · Cloudflare Workers KV docs","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/kv/platform/